<title>FINLAND: FINNISH SISU 1996 PROFIT FALLS 49 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>FINNISH SISU 1996 PROFIT FALLS 49 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December-</p>
<p>					  (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		   112 vs 219</p>
<p> Net sales					  5,760 vs 6,021</p>
<p> Operating profit				   246 vs 379</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  112 vs 209</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    28.1 vs 26.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish heavy vehicles maker is Sisu</p>
<p>Oy. Sisu and Finnish cargo handling equipment and building</p>
<p>materials group Partek Oy Ab have agreed to merge during 1997.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 680 50 240</p>
</text>
